OL,3,GNEWSADeath of gran crushed by collapsed
OL,4,Awall 'was preventable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns about a bowing wall of a
OL,7,Frental property which collapsed and
OL,8,Fcrushed a woman beneath it were
OL,9,Freported nearly eight years before her
OL,10,Fdeath, a coroner found.
OL,12,FClarice Berry died from chest injuries
OL,13,Fsuffered when the gable wall of her
OL,14,Fhome in in Shevington, Wigan, collapsed
OL,15,Fon to her in July 2021, trapping her
OL,16,Fbeneath the rubble.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40802
