OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1789676910
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADeath of gran crushed by collapsed
OL,4,Awall 'was preventable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 77-year-old was in the lean-to
OL,7,Fcarport beneath the gable end of the
OL,8,Fproperty when the entirety of the gable
OL,9,Fwall and the upper part of the outer
OL,10,Fleaf of the end wall, weighing around
OL,11,F3,800kg, collapsed.
OL,13,FIn a prevention of future deaths report
OL,14,Fpublished on Thursday, coroner Bronia
OL,15,FHartley said Berry's husband reported
OL,16,Fthe bowing wall nearly eight years
OL,17,Fbeforehand.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
